          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 14.28-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Numara kurobanura kimwe mu icumi cy'ibyo wejeje byose mu mwaka wa gatatu, ari wo mwaka wo kurobanura kimwe mu icumi cya byose, uzajye ubiha Umulewi n'umusuhuke w'umunyamahanga, n'impfubyi n'umupfakazi kugira ngo barīre iwanyu bahage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvugire imbere y'Uwiteka Imana yawe uti “Nakuye ibyera byose mu nzu yanjye mbiha Umulewi n'umusuhuke w'umunyamahanga, n'impfubyi n'umupfakazi uko amategeko yawe yose wantegetse ari. Sinagize na rimwe ryo muri ayo mategeko yawe ncumura, kandi sinayibagiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sinigeze kurya ibyo byera nkirabuye kandi nta byo nabitse ngihumanye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "nta . . . ngihumanye:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cyangwa, sinabikuriyeho kubikoresha ibyanduye.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi sinabitanze ho ibinyagano, ahubwo numviye Uwiteka Imana yanjye, nitondeye ibyo wantegetse byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Curika amaso uri mu ijuru ubuturo bwawe bwera, uhāne ubwoko bwawe Abisirayeli umugisha n'ubutaka waduhaye bw'igihugu cy'amata n'ubuki, nk'uko warahiye ba sogokuruza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyu munsi Uwiteka Imana yawe igutegetse kumvira ayo mategeko n'ayo mateka. Nuko ujye ushyira umutima wawe wose n'ubugingo bwawe bwose kuyitondera no kuyumvira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyu munsi wasezeranishije Uwiteka kuba Imana yawe, kugira ngo uhore ugenda mu nzira ikuyoboye, witondere amategeko yayo n'ibyo yagutegetse n'amateka yayo, wumvire ibyo ikubwiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
